-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Oct 30 22:24:50 UTC 2026 - asnelt@asnelt.org

- Update to version 1.4.0
  * Added --verbose option for printing changed lines, also when
    simulating replacement with the --dry-run option.
  * Added support for multibyte characters.
  * Added --dereference-recursive option to follow all symlinks.
  * Made include and exclude options consistent with GNU grep.
  * Made symbolic link following consistent with GNU grep.
  * Changed backups to always be created as new files.
  * Removed possibility to combine standard input with other files.
  * Fixed memory leaks.
  * Changed directory tree traversal to use GNU Gnulib module fts.
  * Updated GNU Gnulib modules and changed module selection.
- Moved upstream from SourceForge to sourcehut and updated URL and
  Source0 accordingly.
- Added upstream signature and keyring for source verification.
- Removed unused autoconf and automake BuildRequires.
- Removed obsolete install-info scriptlets and info requirements.

